#X text 20 10 HEBB: store the current groove. For every pair (i \, j) with i != j: W_ij = W_ij + s_i * s_j / 32 - the weights are a 32 x 32 table hw\$0 \, entry k = i * 32 + j. [expr] can WRITE to an array with "=". "forget" clears it., f 120;
