#X text 20 10 MEASURE after every change. OVERLAP with memory p = (1/32) * sum of s_i * memory_p[i]: +1 = exactly that groove \, -1 = its negative \, near 0 = unrelated. ENERGY E = -1/2 * sum over i \, j of W_ij s_i s_j: it can only go down while recalling. When the state is exactly a memory we print it once., f 140;
#X obj 20 70 inlet;
#X obj 100 70 r \$0-measure;
#X obj 20 96 t b b b b;
#X msg 400 96 0 0 0 0;
#X obj 400 122 unpack f f f f;
#X obj 400 148 v oA_\$0;
#X obj 470 148 v oB_\$0;
